From 1b27b030808820271dc9abe7ecdbae6438f9a5d2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Penny Zheng <Penny.Zheng@arm.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Jul 2023 15:21:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] xen/arm: introduce GICv4.1 on ARM platform

Aim of this big patch is to introduce GICv4.1 on ARM platform. GICv4.1
is an extension to GICv3, with new features of direct vLPI/vSGI direct
injection.

upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Kronos-specific]
Signed-off-by: Penny Zheng <penny.zheng@arm.com>
